Section 3 — Facility Description
The proposed distributed energy resource is a rooftop photovoltaic generating facility installed across the two principal
buildings of the Municipal Service Center (Building A — fleet maintenance; Building B — public works administration
and storage). The array will operate behind the customer's revenue meter, offsetting site load with export permitted during
periods when generation exceeds coincident on-site demand.
